{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07613","headline":"同诸公谒啓母祠 · 崔曙","name":"同诸公谒啓母祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"閟宫凌紫微，芳草闭闲扉。\n帝子复何在，王孙游不归。\n春风鸣玉佩，暮雨拂灵衣。\n岂但湘江口，能令怀二妃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}